---
import AboutHeroImage from '../assets/blog-placeholder-about.jpg';
import Layout from '../layouts/BlogPost.astro';
---

<Layout
	title="About"
	description="A practitioner focused on turning AI into productivity."
	pubDate={new Date('2026-01-20')}
	heroImage={AboutHeroImage}
>
	<p>
		I'm a practitioner focused on efficiency and collaboration, with a long-term interest in AI,
		product thinking, and career growth.
	</p>
	<p>
		This blog records my real-world practices: experiments I've run, pitfalls I've hit, and
		methodologies distilled from retrospectives.
	</p>
	<p>
		If you're also exploring how to fold AI into daily work, or looking for a clearer career
		path, I'd love to hear from you — the email is in the site header and footer.
	</p>
</Layout>
